DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
4143::$$$message_0031_0000_0000$$$::"Hm?"[lr]::
4144::$$$message_0031_0000_0001$$$::Huh, the doorbell? I'm not expecting any visitors. Maybe it's a delivery, or a newspaper salesperson.::
4145::$$$message_0031_0001_0000$$$::I get up and go to the front door.[lr]::
4146::$$$message_0031_0001_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
4147::$$$message_0031_0001_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
4148::$$$message_0031_0001_0003$$$::...I hear voices talking.[lr]::
4149::$$$message_0031_0001_0004$$$::Someone arrived to greet the visitor before I could.::
4150::$$$message_0031_0002_0000$$$::"Welcome and well met. Are you here to see Sakura or Shirou?"[lr]::
4151::$$$message_0031_0002_0001$$$::I hear Rider's voice around the corner.[lr]::
4152::$$$message_0031_0002_0002$$$::I'm glad she's being so polite.[lr]::
4153::$$$message_0031_0002_0003$$$::But the visitor doesn't seem nearly as composed.::
4154::$$$message_0031_0003_0000$$$::"Urgh... M-Miss Rider?"[lr]::
4155::$$$message_0031_0003_0001$$$::"Yes. Good day to you. It has been a while since we met outside the kyudo club, Ayako."[lr]::
4156::$$$message_0031_0003_0002$$$::Mitsuzuri is the visitor.[lr]::
4157::$$$message_0031_0003_0003$$$::Sakura is here, so if she needs to speak about the club, it makes sense that she'd come here.::
4158::$$$message_0031_0004_0000$$$::"Oh, you're just, uh, so pretty as usual.[lr]::
4159::$$$message_0031_0004_0001$$$::Aha. Hahaha, ha..."[lr]::
4160::$$$message_0031_0004_0002$$$::"Thank you. But I could say the same for you. In fact, I'd say you strike a gallant figure.[lr]::
4161::$$$message_0031_0004_0003$$$::Both your face and your whole appearance are so charmingly androgynous."[lr]::
4162::$$$message_0031_0004_0004$$$::"Eh? [cacheimage storage=美綴私服02e(遠)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg storage=美綴私服02e(遠) pos=r time=300 textoff=0]A-aw, you're making me blush..."::
4163::$$$message_0031_0005_0000$$$::...What a suspicious atmosphere.[lr]::
4164::$$$message_0031_0005_0001$$$::No, Rider's the only one acting suspicious. She's being so friendly it gives me chills, compared to her usual unreadable demeanor.::
4165::$$$message_0031_0006_0000$$$::"...She's like a snake eyeing a mouse."[lr]::
4166::$$$message_0031_0006_0001$$$::Mitsuzuri's a skilled martial artist, so she must instinctively sense the threat.[lr]::
4167::$$$message_0031_0006_0002$$$::I remember she said she wasn't good at dealing with Rider, so she must feel utterly cornered right now...::
4168::$$$message_0031_0007_0000$$$::"Now, what business do you have here today?"[lr]::
4169::$$$message_0031_0007_0001$$$::"Ah... [cacheimage storage=美綴私服02e(遠)][wvl][chgfg time=200 storage=美綴私服02e(遠) textoff=0]Um, I'm looking for Matou."[lr]::
4170::$$$message_0031_0007_0002$$$::"[movefg opacity=255 time=600 pos=rc accel=-2 storage=ライダー私服01d(遠) textoff=0][move time=180 path=(517,160,255)(574,132,255)(607,155,255)(617,132,255) storage=美綴私服02e(遠) accel=-2 spline=1 textoff=0][say storage=emi0316_rad_0040 name=ライダー]Is this regarding the kyudo club?[lr]::
4171::$$$message_0031_0007_0003$$$::...You're very thoughtful of your juniors. I feel a need to thank you on behalf of Sakura."[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0][lr]::
4172::$$$message_0031_0007_0004$$$::[chgfg time=200 storage=ライダー私服01c(遠),美綴私服02d(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=330 top=79 time=1200 accel=-2 storage=ライダー私服01c(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=637 top=132 time=800 accel=-2 storage=美綴私服02d(遠) textoff=0]Rider chuckles while seductively backing Mitsuzuri up against the wall.::
4173::$$$message_0031_0008_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
4174::$$$message_0031_0008_0001$$$::She's enjoying teasing Mitsuzuri...I hope. It's hard to tell what Rider's really thinking.[lr]::
4175::$$$message_0031_0008_0002$$$::She regards Sakura above anyone else, so she might actually be sincere in her gratitude.[wm canskip=0][wm canskip=0]::
4176::$$$message_0031_0009_0000$$$::"N-no, I don't deserve your thanks... I just do it because I like it, so there's no need to be so polite..."[lr]::
4177::$$$message_0031_0009_0001$$$::"Why, that's wonderful. I'm doing this because I like it too, so I hope you'll accept my gratitude."::
4178::$$$message_0031_0010_0000$$$::"By the way, Ayako, have you been eating a balanced diet lately?[lr]::
4179::$$$message_0031_0010_0001$$$::It appears you don't eat much meat, so there isn't much fat content in your blood. That may sound like a good thing, but I worry for your richness."::
4180::$$$message_0031_0011_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
4181::$$$message_0031_0011_0001$$$::Hold on.[lr]::
4182::$$$message_0031_0011_0002$$$::That sounded awfully sinister, Rider.::
4183::$$$message_0031_0012_0000$$$::"B-b-blood!? What are you talking about, Miss Rider!? Why are we talking about this, anyway...!?"[lr]::
4184::$$$message_0031_0012_0001$$$::"It was just a metaphor.[lr]::
4185::$$$message_0031_0012_0002$$$::If you'd like to understand... I know, I could explain in my room."::
4186::$$$message_0031_0013_0000$$$::"Uh...no, um...[lr]::
4187::$$$message_0031_0013_0001$$$::Hey Emiya, Matou, I know you're watching! Help!"::
4188::$$$message_0031_0014_0000$$$::Busted.[lr]::
4189::$$$message_0031_0014_0001$$$::N-nah, she was just throwing that out there.[lr]::
4190::$$$message_0031_0014_0002$$$::After all, it's just me here, not Sakura.::
4191::$$$message_0031_0015_0000$$$::"I'm impressed, Senpai. You noticed me."[lr]::
4192::$$$message_0031_0015_0001$$$::"Waah!"[lr]::
4193::$$$message_0031_0015_0002$$$::A-at some point Sakura was watching too?[lr]::
4194::$$$message_0031_0015_0003$$$::I was so engrossed in watching Mitsuzuri's predicament that I completely failed to notice her.::
4195::$$$message_0031_0016_0000$$$::"You two have really bad taste, siccing her on me while grinning from the shadows. You aren't supposed to be like Tohsaka!"[lr]::
4196::$$$message_0031_0016_0001$$$::"Aw, I didn't mean to do that."[lr]::
4197::$$$message_0031_0016_0002$$$::"It was just a coincidence."::
4198::$$$message_0031_0017_0000$$$::"Oh, looks like I'm out of time."[lr]::
4199::$$$message_0031_0017_0001$$$::Rider pulls back once Sakura shows up.[lr]::
4200::$$$message_0031_0017_0002$$$::It's a very graceful movement.::
4201::$$$message_0031_0018_0000$$$::"Don't act so disappointed, Rider. [cacheimage storage=美綴私服02c(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=美綴私服02c(中) textoff=0]You can see Mitsuzuri at the kyudo club whenever you want."::
4202::$$$message_0031_0019_0000$$$::"That's right. I'm sure you'll become fast friends. So hang in there, Rider."[lr]::
4203::$$$message_0031_0019_0001$$$::"True... Unfortunately, I still haven't completely moved on from past pains,[cacheimage storage=ライダー私服01a(中)][wvl canskip=false time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=ライダー私服01a(中) textoff=0] and I wouldn't want to rush things now, so I'll take my leave.[lr]::
4204::$$$message_0031_0019_0002$$$::Take good care of Sakura, Ayako."[lr]::
4205::$$$message_0031_0019_0003$$$::Rider leaves the entrance.::
4206::$$$message_0031_0020_0000$$$::"...Whew. I didn't think I'd run into her here. That threw me for a loop."[lr]::
4207::$$$message_0031_0020_0001$$$::"Ah, sorry Senpai, but let me give you a belated welcome."[lr]::
4208::$$$message_0031_0020_0002$$$::"Hey Mitsuzuri, what's up? Come on in."::
4209::$$$message_0031_0021_0000$$$::"Thanks, pardon the intrusion."[lr]::
4210::$$$message_0031_0021_0001$$$::"Ah, [cacheimage storage=桜私服04b(中)][wvl][movefg opacity=255 time=600 pos=l accel=-2 storage=桜私服04b(中) textoff=0]I'll make some tea."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
4211::$$$message_0031_0021_0002$$$::"Huh? ...Okay. Thanks, Sakura."::
4212::$$$message_0031_0022_0000$$$::"...Huh."[lr]::
4213::$$$message_0031_0022_0001$$$::"What?"[lr]::
4214::$$$message_0031_0022_0002$$$::"Matou. She's totally like a loving commuter wife now."[lr]::
4215::$$$message_0031_0022_0003$$$::   I don't know what to say to that.[lr]::
4216::$$$message_0031_0022_0004$$$::Argh, she must be getting me back for Rider.::
4217::$$$message_0031_0023_0000$$$::"Stop pulling my leg. She isn't the only other one who lives here, you know. There's Rider and Saber, and..."::
4218::$$$message_0031_0024_0000$$$::"Tohsaka and Ms. Fujimura too, right? How lively. [cacheimage storage=美綴私服01b(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=美綴私服01b(中) time=300 textoff=0]But as long as Matou's happy to be your dear visiting wife."[lr]::
4219::$$$message_0031_0024_0001$$$::"Mrgh..."[lr]::
4220::$$$message_0031_0024_0002$$$::She might have a point, but I don't know.::
4221::$$$message_0031_0025_0000$$$::"Love makes people stronger, eh? Maybe I really should get myself a boyfriend."[lr]::
4222::$$$message_0031_0025_0001$$$::"Ah... You still don't have one after that, huh?"[lr]::
4223::$$$message_0031_0025_0002$$$::"Nope. As an aftereffect from that whole thing, I avoided guys for a while, until now. All the ones around me are busy thinking about their futures, too."::
4224::$$$message_0031_0026_0000$$$::"That time" must be referring to the incident in April.[lr]::
4225::$$$message_0031_0026_0001$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=美綴私服01a(中) textoff=0]I miss those days a little, but they were also a nightmare I have trouble forgetting. I can't believe she went that far...::
4226::$$$message_0031_0027_0000$$$::"I'll say it as many times as I have to, but that didn't count. Why do I have to go along with what Tohsaka says in this situation?"[lr]::
4227::$$$message_0031_0027_0001$$$::"You have to admit, what you did wasn't a great look."::
4228::$$$message_0031_0028_0000$$$::"Even you turned a blind eye to her schemes.[lr]::
4229::$$$message_0031_0028_0001$$$::Honestly, there's something at your core that's so cold or robotic. I never figured you for such a stone-hearted, friendless person."[lr]::
4230::$$$message_0031_0028_0002$$$::"Uh, what is she talking about, [cacheimage storage=美綴私服02a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=美綴私服02a(中) textoff=0]Senpai?"::
4231::$$$message_0031_0029_0000$$$::"Ahaha... Just a battle I lost. Sorry, Matou. I'd rather not talk about it now."[lr]::
4232::$$$message_0031_0029_0001$$$::"Yeah, it ended in a winner-takes-all outcome for Tohsaka."[lr]::
4233::$$$message_0031_0029_0002$$$::"Haah... Were you playing mahjong or something?"[lr]::
4234::$$$message_0031_0029_0003$$$::If only it was that harmless.[lr]::
4235::$$$message_0031_0029_0004$$$::It was so incredibly embarrassing and pathetic that I don't feel comfortable talking about it to other people.::
4236::$$$message_0031_0030_0000$$$::"Anyway! Thanks for the tea, Matou."[lr]::
4237::$$$message_0031_0030_0001$$$::"Yes, please take your time to enjoy it."[lr]::
4238::$$$message_0031_0030_0002$$$::"Um... Would you like some bubuzuke? Don't let the door hit you on the way out..."::
4239::$$$message_0031_0031_0000$$$::"Funny joke, Emiya. That's what you say to get someone out of your house, not welcome them."[lr]::
4240::$$$message_0031_0031_0001$$$::"Ochazuke with salmon and plum in it does sound quite tasteful."[lr]::
4241::$$$message_0031_0031_0002$$$::"Yeah, if we made it with bonito stock instead of tea, [cacheimage storage=桜私服09a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服09a(中) textoff=0]it would be quite light."::
4242::$$$message_0031_0032_0000$$$::Sakura drifts off-topic to cooking, but I'm all for it.[lr]::
4243::$$$message_0031_0032_0001$$$::Mitsuzuri sighs at us and says.::
4244::$$$message_0031_0033_0000$$$::"Haaah. Watching you two makes me so jealous I want to bless you at the altar myself."[lr]::
4245::$$$message_0031_0033_0001$$$::"Wha-[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]what are you talking about, Senpai!? W-who is marrying whom!?"::
4246::$$$message_0031_0034_0000$$$::"Don't be so shy, Matou! You're cute."[lr]::
4247::$$$message_0031_0034_0001$$$::"Please stop laughing too, Senpai!"[lr]::
4248::$$$message_0031_0034_0002$$$::"I'm not laughing! I'm starting to panic, too!"[lr]::
4249::$$$message_0031_0034_0003$$$::I don't mean to brag, but the hand holding my teacup is trembling violently.::
4250::$$$message_0031_0035_0000$$$::"See? That's why I say April doesn't count. If you and Matou are this lovey-dovey, [cacheimage storage=桜私服10e頬(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜私服10e頬(中) textoff=0]then things must be off with Tohsaka."[lr]::
4251::$$$message_0031_0035_0001$$$::"I'd like you to bring that up to her directly... Anyway, you wanted to talk to Sakura?"::
4252::$$$message_0031_0036_0000$$$::"Right, right. I got carried away teasing you. Matou, about the tournament coming up..."[lr]::
4253::$$$message_0031_0036_0001$$$::"Yes?"[lr]::
4254::$$$message_0031_0036_0002$$$::   The farcical atmosphere vanishes, and they get down to business.[lr]::
4255::$$$message_0031_0036_0003$$$::I'll just listen without getting in the way.::
904150::$$$message_9031_0002_0000$$$::"Welcome and well met. Are you here to see Sakura or Shirou?"[r]::g